590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a statement. This statement is <em>true</em> because the intersection of the given sets is indeed the set <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.134ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 1780 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\{6\\}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-7B\" d=\"M434 -231Q434 -244 428 -250H410Q281 -250 230 -184Q225 -177 222 -172T217 -161T213 -148T211 -133T210 -111T209 -84T209 -47T209 0Q209 21 209 53Q208 142 204 153Q203 154 203 155Q189 191 153 211T82 231Q71 231 68 234T65 250T68 266T82 269Q116 269 152 289T203 345Q208 356 208 377T209 529V579Q209 634 215 656T244 698Q270 724 324 740Q361 748 377 749Q379 749 390 749T408 750H428Q434 744 434 732Q434 719 431 716Q429 713 415 713Q362 710 332 689T296 647Q291 634 291 499V417Q291 370 288 353T271 314Q240 271 184 255L170 250L184 245Q202 239 220 230T262 196T290 137Q291 131 291 1Q291 -134 296 -147Q306 -174 339 -192T415 -213Q429 -213 431 -216Q434 -219 434 -231Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-36\" d=\"M42 313Q42 476 123 571T303 666Q372 666 402 630T432 550Q432 525 418 510T379 495Q356 495 341 509T326 548Q326 592 373 601Q351 623 311 626Q240 626 194 566Q147 500 147 364L148 360Q153 366 156 373Q197 433 263 433H267Q313 433 348 414Q372 400 396 374T435 317Q456 268 456 210V192Q456 169 451 149Q440 90 387 34T253 -22Q225 -22 199 -14T143 16T92 75T56 172T42 313ZM257 397Q227 397 205 380T171 335T154 278T148 216Q148 133 160 97T198 39Q222 21 251 21Q302 21 329 59Q342 77 347 104T352 209Q352 289 347 316T329 361Q302 397 257